---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PhotoHeader from '../../../components/PhotoHeader.astro';
import { photo } from '../../../data/photos';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base lang="en" alt="finantare/" title="How we are funded" description="The radar stays free. We are funded by courses, services for companies and declared partnerships, with written rules that protect the independence of the scores.">
<PhotoHeader photo={photo('finantare')!} lang="en" title="How we are funded" eyebrow="Independence" summary="The radar stays free. The rules below protect the scores from any influence by those who pay." />
  <p class="lede-f">The radar stays free, for everyone. We are funded by courses, services for companies and declared partnerships. We do not sell signals and we do not give personal recommendations.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Where the money comes from</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table class="radar">
        <thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>What it means</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><b>Courses and workshops</b></td><td>We teach the 14-condition method and how to look for the substance behind the form. We give no tips and do not say what to buy.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><b>Services for companies</b></td><td>Licensing of the weekly data, custom reports on a domain and workshops for teams. <a href={`${base}en/services/`}>See the offer</a>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><b>Declared partnerships</b></td><td>Companies, including EU-authorised brokers, can partner on a domain or the newsletter, under an advertising contract. They are clearly marked “Partner”.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The rules that protect the scores</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><b>Scores are published first, publicly and for free.</b> Nobody pays for hidden information.</li>
      <li><b>Partners and clients do not see scores before publication and cannot influence them.</b> A poor score for an asset linked to a partner stays public.</li>
      <li><b>As financial partners we only accept EU-authorised brokers</b>, checked in the regulator’s public register.</li>
      <li><b>Next to any material from a broker offering CFDs</b> we show the risk warning required by the European authority (ESMA).</li>
      <li><b>Every active partner is listed on this page</b>, with the partnership period.</li><li><b>Anyone who refers a company to us may receive a commission</b>, and the client is told. The rules are on the <a href={`${base}en/partners/`}>Become a partner</a> page.</li>
      <li><b>Scores stay frozen in snapshots with a SHA-256 fingerprint</b>, so they cannot be changed retroactively, whoever pays.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Active partners</h2>
    <p class="notice">None yet. When we sign the first contract, the partner appears here, with the period and the domain.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Conflicts of interest</h2>
    <p>The author holds or has held positions in Lighter (LIT) and uses Polymarket. We do not change scores based on our positions.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who invoices and how to contact us</h2>
    <p>EtiQ Events SRL · VAT ID RO 30586107 · <a href="mailto:nitadanielcristian@gmail.com">nitadanielcristian@gmail.com</a></p>
    <p class="muted">The content is for information and education only and is not investment advice. <a href={`${base}en/`}>Home</a> · <a href={`${base}en/methodology/`}>Methodology</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede-f { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 760px; }
  ol li { margin: .45rem 0; }
</style>
